activity Implement Security Patch
bind Detect Fraudulent Activity: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount, Fraud Risk Level
bind Verify Customer Identity: Verification Attempts, Verification Status
bind Review Transaction Details: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Approve Transaction: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Decline Transaction: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Report Suspicious Activity: Transaction Type, Transaction Amount
bind Update Account Security: Days Since Last Activity
bind Notify Customer: Customer Notification Method
bind Investigate Security Breach: Breach Severity
bind Implement Security Patch: Security Patch Status
Transaction Type: Debit, Credit, Wire Transfer, Online Payment
Transaction Amount: float between 0.01 and 100000.0
Fraud Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Verification Attempts: integer between 1 and 5
Verification Status: Verified, Not Verified, Pending
Breach Severity: integer between 1 and 10
Security Patch Status: Applied, Not Applied, Scheduled
Customer Notification Method: Email, SMS, Phone Call
Days Since Last Activity: integer between 0 and 365
